ener\">belomaxorka</a>)</li>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\">Fixed empty user search box <a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/pull/785\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#785</a> (<a href=\"https://github.com/belomaxorka\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">belomaxorka</a>)</li>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\">Fixed null $u_data if user not found <a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/pull/783\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#783</a> (<a href=\"https://github.com/belomaxorka\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">belomaxorka</a>)</li>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\">Added missing properties in User class <a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/pull/782\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#782</a> (<a href=\"https://github.com/belomaxorka\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">belomaxorka</a>)</li>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\">Fixed some deprecations <a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/pull/777\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#777</a> (<a href=\"https://github.com/belomaxorka\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">belomaxorka</a>)</li>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\">Fixed: preg_match(): Passing null to parameter <a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/pull/776\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#776</a> (<a href=\"https://github.com/belomaxorka\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">belomaxorka</a>)</li>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\">Reformated JS <a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/pull/770\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow 